1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,870
On a small rocky island there was an
old lighthouse and a keeper named Mara.

2
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:07,840
Every evening she climbed the 120
steps to light the great lamp.

3
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:09,140
Most nights were quiet.

4
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:13,200
She watched the fishing boats come home
and the gulls settle on the rocks, but one

5
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,380
winter night a storm
rolled in from the sea.

6
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:18,150
The wind howled and the waves
crashed against the walls.

7
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:20,950
Suddenly the power went
out and the lamp went dark.

8
00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:23,760
Mara knew a ship was still
out there in the rain.

9
00:00:24,180 --> 00:00:28,280
She found an old oil lantern, lit it with
shaking hands and held it high in the

10
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:28,825
window.

11
00:00:29,090 --> 00:00:32,820
For hours she stood there, refilling the
oil and keeping the small flame alive.

12
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:35,070
At dawn the storm finally passed.

13
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:38,350
Far below a fishing boat
sailed safely into the harbour.

14
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:41,420
The captain looked up and waved
at the tiny light in the tower.

15
00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:46,160
Mara smiled, blew out the lantern and went
down the steps to make a hot cup of tea.
